<title>USA: Concord EFS increases share offering.</title>
<headline>Concord EFS increases share offering.</headline>
<dateline>MEMPHIS, Tenn. 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Concord EFS Inc said on Monday that it has amended its registration statement with the Securities and Exchange Commission to increase a previously announced share offering to three million shares from 2 million.</p>
<p>The company originally filed the registration statement on October 2, 1996, Concord EFS said.</p>
<p>The option available to underwriters for over-allotments was increased to 450,000 shares from 300,000, Concord EFS said.</p>
</text>
